163 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[41.047 433.211 274.453 503.211]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213190410Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(We target large Facility Management \(FM\) agencies \(e.g., Wisag,\) in contract with Corporate HQs and High rise structures. We enhance their value proposition by enabling them to offer "Green, Safe, & Data-Driven" facade cleaning to their existing clients without needing to build the tech themselves. We solve their labor shortage crisis and increasing profit-margin.)/NM(Zotero-BAS2IGAX)/Zotero:Key(BAS2IGAX)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[41.047 433.211 274.453 503.211]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 8/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 8 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 164 0 R>>>>endobj
