165 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[326.984 433.68 586.641 503.68]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213190422Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(Hardware: A mechanical drone attachment \(rotatory brush\)\n\nSoftware: A data pipeline to maintain building's maintenance reports through BIM scanning.)/NM(Zotero-GHDEU6HL)/Zotero:Key(GHDEU6HL)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[326.984 433.68 586.641 503.68]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 10.5/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 10.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]>>endobj
166 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[33.547 222.055 268.359 288.055]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213190443Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(By becoming the exclusive technology supplier for agencies we restrict competitor drone manufacturers \(like Aerones or KTV\). We focus on execution speed. We provide certified pilots and ready-to-use drone mechanism, so they can use our tech faster than they could build it internally.)/NM(Zotero-PGQJPMYT)/Zotero:Key(PGQJPMYT)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[33.547 222.055 268.359 288.055]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 8.5/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 8.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 167 0 R>>>>endobj
