168 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[320.422 217.586 574.453 287.586]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213190454Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(Unlike a standard drone cleaning companies, we will focus on regulatory support \(permits\), and maintenance. The solution will be less labour intensive, helping the agencies to maintain control over costs and resources.)/NM(Zotero-H24IZ5NC)/Zotero:Key(H24IZ5NC)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[320.422 217.586 574.453 287.586]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 11/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 11 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 169 0 R>>>>endobj
