272 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[264.14 38.875 545.39 108.875]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213191147Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(The venture captures value by executing a specialized, difficult-to-replace function within the value chain through a Hardware-as-a-Service model. Facility management firms pay a recurring monthly lease for the drone system and a per-project fee for data processing and reporting. This model creates recurring revenue and partner lock-in, as switching providers would require workforce retraining and result in the loss of accumulated operational and historical inspection data.)/NM(Zotero-UACTKRVD)/Zotero:Key(UACTKRVD)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[264.14 38.875 545.39 108.875]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 7.5/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 7.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 273 0 R>>>>endobj
