426 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[320.391 44.395 538.36 116.395]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213202704Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(Key uncertainties include:\nTechnical feasibility and stability of integrating commercial drones with proprietary brush-based cleaning attachments.\nFlight safety, cleaning consistency, and glass-surface compatibility under real urban conditions.\nRegulatory and insurance acceptance of repeated drone-based operations.\nWhether a Digital Service Report containing thermal diagnostics and "before/after" heat maps, can solve their "verification gap.".)/NM(Zotero-45PU5IPG)/Zotero:Key(45PU5IPG)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[320.391 44.395 538.36 116.395]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 6/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 6 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]>>endobj
