552 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[39.5 58.677 268.5 165.88]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213163202Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(We operate the business as a cleaning company. We hire pilots, buy vans, and sell cleaning contracts directly to Building Owners \(e.g., Beiersdorf, Company HQs\).\nWe compete against manual climbers & other cleaning drone services.)/NM(Zotero-YX23748C)/Zotero:Key(YX23748C)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[39.5 58.677 268.5 165.88]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 12.5/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 12.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]>>endobj
553 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[354.3 63.68 556.84 167.417]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213162953Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(We operate as a hardware/software service supplier. We focus on R&D and manufacturing. We lease the drone system to Facility Management Service Firms \(e.g., Wisag, Strabag\) so they can use it to clean their clients' buildings.)/NM(Zotero-UH5NIGBS)/Zotero:Key(UH5NIGBS)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[354.3 63.68 556.84 167.417]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 12/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 12 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]/AP<</N 554 0 R>>>>endobj
