655 0 obj<</Type/Annot/Rect[332.5 435.424 572.083 516.424]/Subtype/FreeText/M(D:20260213174121Z00'00')/T<>/Contents(successfully navigating the strict regulations and removing the heavy urban soot characteristic of this niche provides technical proof that the system works in "worst-case" scenarios, establishing the operational and safety credentials necessary to later win contracts with risk-averse global corporate headquarters.\nThe specialized, high-cost technology required to meet strict German regulations and remove heavy urban soot is likely "over-engineered" and too expensive for global customers who lack these rigorous mandates and are satisfied with simple cleanliness.)/NM(Zotero-KTXD9RKC)/Zotero:Key(KTXD9RKC)/Zotero:AuthorName<>/Zotero:Rect[332.5 435.424 572.083 516.424]/Zotero:Rotation 0/Zotero:FontSize 7/Zotero:Color[0 0 0]/DA(/Helvetica 7 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/F 4/CA 1/Border[0 0 1]>>endobj
